Directions: For this part, you are allowed 30 minutes to write a short essay entitled My Opinion on the Popularity of Micro blog. You should write at least 150 words following the outline given below. 
1. Micro blog has enjoyed its popularity in recent times; 
2. Discuss the advantages and disadvantages of Micro blog; 
3. Offer some suggestions to college students on how to make good use of Micro blog.

Directions: For this part, you are allowed 30 minutes to write a short essay entitled My Opinion on Educational Standards. You should write at least 150 words following the outline given below. 
1. Educational standards have declined in recent times, particularly in the areas of literacy (识字能力) and numeracy (计算能力); 
2. Discuss the causes of this problem; 
3. Offer some possible solutions to this phenomenon.

